# Level 49, reached by password XWJR, then a box walked with fire held.
#
# **This is a probe rather than a route.** Fifteen of the sixteen movies before
# these were aimed at something -- an object, a victim, a branch the coverage
# report had named -- and every one of them cost a round of route-finding. What
# these nine are for is the other half of the work: the decline census had gone
# empty, which meant no input the project had reached a routine the port did not
# have, and the only way to find the next routine was to make the game run code
# nobody had run yet. Passwords reach thirteen levels; the corpus had five.
#
# The tail is deliberately not a route. It holds Y and walks Right/Down/Left/Up
# for 180 frames each, twelve legs, which is enough to put shots on the screen,
# be touched by whatever this level places, and let the level's own actors reach
# their handlers. What it is measured by is the census, not by where it ends up.
#
# Census: `$82:DEEB`, 12 declines.
#
